{"id": "34333", "title": "天地不容(负心人2)", "author": "碧洛", "category": "文学名著", "count": 44, "available": 0, "cover": "", "status": "已完成", "source": "files/article/info/34/34333.htm", "intro": "负心的人天地不容！他该谨记她负心的事实，报复她才是，但再见到她的身影，他仍受到震撼。那份藏于心中的情意怎么也比恨浓烈，她的人终究是回到他身边，可是心呢？她是否仍念着另一个人，早已忘了与他的诺言？不过……他会让她记起昔日的一切的。就算耗到老、耗到死、耗到世界末日也无所谓！曾被背叛的刺痛虽然至今犹狠狠啃噬着他，他这个深情的傻子却执意去爱她，反倒使这份爱压得彼此之间喘不过气。历史再度重演，她又离他而去，只是这次换他负了她，误会她的真心……", "base": "files/article/html/34/34333", "chapters": [{"title": "楔子", "file": "2181892.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第1页", "file": "2181893.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第2页", "file": "2181894.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第3页", "file": "2181895.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第4页", "file": "2181896.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第5页", "file": "2181897.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第6页", "file": "2181898.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第7页", "file": "2181899.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第8页", "file": "2181900.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第9页", "file": "2181901.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第10页", "file": "2181902.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第11页", "file": "2181903.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第12页", "file": "2181904.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第13页", "file": "2181905.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第14页", "file": "2181906.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第15页", "file": "2181907.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第16页", "file": "2181908.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第17页", "file": "2181909.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第18页", "file": "2181910.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第19页", "file": "2181911.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第20页", "file": "2181912.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第21页", "file": "2181913.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第22页", "file": "2181914.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第23页", "file": "2181915.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第24页", "file": "2181916.ht